\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"aug_sun_mj\\\"}, {\\\"name\\\": \\\"sep_sun_mj\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"sep_sun_mj\\\"}, {\\\"name\\\": \\\"oct_sun_mj\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"oct_sun_mj\\\"}, {\\\"name\\\": \\\"nov_sun_mj\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"nov_sun_mj\\\"}, {\\\"name\\\": \\\"dec_sun_mj\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"dec_sun_mj\\\"}, {\\\"name\\\": \\\"hotels_tourism_pois\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"hotels_tourism_pois\\\"}, {\\\"name\\\": \\\"healthcare_pois\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"healthcare_pois\\\"}, {\\\"name\\\": \\\"restaurant_pois\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"restaurant_pois\\\"}, {\\\"name\\\": \\\"population\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"population\\\"}, {\\\"name\\\": \\\"map_cells\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"map_cells\\\"}, {\\\"name\\\": \\\"r8_cells\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"r8_cells\\\"}]\",\"parent\":\"lefttable\",\"optional\":true,\"description\":\"Left table columns\"},{\"name\":\"righttablekeycolumn\",\"type\":\"Column\",\"title\":\"Key column in right table\",\"value\":\"area_id\",\"parent\":\"righttable\",\"dataType\":[\"boolean\",\"date\",\"datetime\",\"time\",\"timestamp\",\"number\",\"string\"],\"description\":\"Key column in right table\"},{\"name\":\"righttablecolumns\",\"type\":\"ColumnsForJoin\",\"title\":\"Right table columns\",\"value\":\"[{\\\"name\\\": \\\"pct_forest\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"pct_forest\\\"}, {\\\"name\\\": \\\"pct_shrub\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"pct_shrub\\\"}, {\\\"name\\\": \\\"pct_grass\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"pct_grass\\\"}, {\\\"name\\\": \\\"pct_barren\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"pct_barren\\\"}, {\\\"name\\\": \\\"pct_snow\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"pct_snow\\\"}, {\\\"name\\\": \\\"pct_water\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"pct_water\\\"}, {\\\"name\\\": \\\"pct_developed\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"pct_developed\\\"}, {\\\"name\\\": \\\"pct_wetland\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"pct_wetland\\\"}, {\\\"name\\\": \\\"pct_crop\\\", \\\"joinname\\\": \\\"pct_crop\\\"}]\",\"parent\":\"righttable\",\"optional\":true,\"description\":\"Right table columns\"},{\"name\":\"jointype\",\"type\":\"Selection\",\"title\":\"Join type\",\"value\":\"Left\",\"default\":\"Inner\",\"options\":[\"Inner\",\"Left\",\"Right\",\"Full outer\"],\"description\":\"Join type\"},{\"name\":\"whereclause\",\"type\":\"StringSql\",\"title\":\"Where clause\",\"advanced\":true,\"optional\":true,\"description\":\"Where clause\"}],\"version\":\"1\"},\"type\":\"generic\",\"position\":{\"x\":2672,\"y\":0},\"selected\":false},{\"id\":\"note_overview\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#E5E5E5\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":360,\"height\":820,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: Workflow 1 \\u00b7 Look (fast)\\n---\\n## 1 \\u00b7 Look (fast): uploaded land cover\\nSame output as **1 \\u00b7 Look**, but land cover comes from the uploaded `film_landcover_areas` table instead of the USDA raster, so it runs in about a minute.\\n\\nUse this version if you want to skip the slow raster step; use **1 \\u00b7 Look** to compute land cover yourself.\\n\\n**Output:** `film_scout_landscape`, read by workflow 2 \\u00b7 Logistics.\\n\\n**Sources:** CARTO Spatial Features (Data Observatory), US Census TIGER states, and `film_landcover_areas` (precomputed from the USDA Cropland Data Layer by 1 \\u00b7 Look).\",\"position\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":-300}},\"type\":\"note\",\"zIndex\":-1,\"position\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":-300},\"selected\":false},{\"id\":\"note_1\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#F6CF71\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":568,\"height\":540,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: 1. Climate, terrain and places\\n---\\n**CARTO Spatial Features**: one row per H3 res-8 cell (about 0.7 km\\u00b2) with elevation, monthly WorldClim climate (1970-2000), POI counts and population.\\n\\n- **Select** keeps the columns we need, adds annual precipitation and each cell's scouting area (`area_id`, res 4).\\n- **H3 To Parent** adds the res-6 cell (`h3_parent`) used to match the western grid.\",\"position\":{\"x\":408,\"y\":-300}},\"type\":\"note\",\"zIndex\":-1,\"position\":{\"x\":408,\"y\":-300},\"selected\":false},{\"id\":\"note_2\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#9EB9F3\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":568,\"height\":540,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: 2. Western US as an H3 grid\\n---\\n- **US states** (TIGER 2024)\\n- **Where** keeps the 11 western states.\\n- **H3 Polyfill** turns them into res-6 cells.\",\"position\":{\"x\":1048,\"y\":-300}},\"type\":\"note\",\"zIndex\":-1,\"position\":{\"x\":1048,\"y\":-300},\"selected\":false},{\"id\":\"note_3\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#87C55F\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":216,\"height\":540,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: 3. Keep cells in the West\\n---\\n**Join** (inner) on the res-6 cell: drops Spatial Features cells outside the 11 states.\",\"position\":{\"x\":1688,\"y\":-300}},\"type\":\"note\",\"zIndex\":-1,\"position\":{\"x\":1688,\"y\":-300},\"selected\":false},{\"id\":\"note_4\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#FE88B1\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":392,\"height\":540,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: 4. Roll up to scouting areas\\n---\\n- **Group by** `area_id`: averages climate, min/max elevation, sums POIs and population, counts cells (`map_cells` = res-6 cells).\\n- **Select** converts units (m \\u2192 ft, \\u00b0C \\u2192 \\u00b0F, mm \\u2192 in) and gives plain names like `oct_high_f`.\",\"position\":{\"x\":1976,\"y\":-300}},\"type\":\"note\",\"zIndex\":-1,\"position\":{\"x\":1976,\"y\":-300},\"selected\":false},{\"id\":\"note_5\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#C9DB74\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":392,\"height\":540,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: 5. Add land cover (uploaded)\\n---\\n- **film_landcover_areas**: % of each scouting area in forest, shrub, grass, barren, snow, water, developed, wetland and crops (USDA Cropland Data Layer).\\n- **Join** (left) on `area_id` adds the nine `pct_` columns.\",\"position\":{\"x\":2440,\"y\":-300}},\"type\":\"note\",\"zIndex\":-1,\"position\":{\"x\":2440,\"y\":-300},\"selected\":false},{\"id\":\"note_6\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#8BE0A4\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":216,\"height\":540,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: 6. Save\\n---\\n**Save as Table** \\u2192 `film_scout_landscape` (one row per scouting area). Same table as 1 \\u00b7 Look, so 2 \\u00b7 Logistics works with either.\",\"position\":{\"x\":2904,\"y\":-300}},\"type\":\"note\",\"zIndex\":-1,\"position\":{\"x\":2904,\"y\":-300},\"selected\":false}],\"edges\":[{\"id\":\"e1\",\"source\":\"s2\",\"target\":\"n3\",\"sourceHandle\":\"out\",\"targetHandle\":\"table\"},{\"id\":\"e2\",\"source\":\"n3\",\"target\":\"n4\",\"sourceHandle\":\"result\",\"targetHandle\":\"source\"},{\"id\":\"e3\",\"source\":\"n4\",\"target\":\"n5\",\"sourceHandle\":\"result\",\"targetHandle\":\"lefttable\"},{\"id\":\"m_e1\",\"source\":\"m_s\",\"target\":\"m_w\",\"sourceHandle\":\"out\",\"targetHandle\":\"source\"},{\"id\":\"m_e2\",\"source\":\"m_w\",\"target\":\"m_p\",\"sourceHandle\":\"match\",\"targetHandle\":\"source\"},{\"id\":\"m_e3\",\"source\":\"m_p\",\"target\":\"n5\",\"sourceHandle\":\"result\",\"targetHandle\":\"righttable\"},{\"id\":\"k_e1\",\"source\":\"e2fa86a3-29c9-4cda-aa7e-6d510790e436\",\"target\":\"f_n1\",\"sourceHandle\":\"result\",\"targetHandle\":\"table\"},{\"id\":\"q_e1\",\"source\":\"n5\",\"target\":\"e2fa86a3-29c9-4cda-aa7e-6d510790e436\",\"sourceHandle\":\"result\",\"targetHandle\":\"source\"},{\"id\":\"q_e2\",\"source\":\"f_n1\",\"target\":\"j_lc\",\"sourceHandle\":\"result\",\"targetHandle\":\"lefttable\"},{\"id\":\"q_e3\",\"source\":\"s_lc\",\"target\":\"j_lc\",\"sourceHandle\":\"out\",\"targetHandle\":\"righttable\"},{\"id\":\"q_e4\",\"source\":\"j_lc\",\"target\":\"f_n10\",\"sourceHandle\":\"result\",\"targetHandle\":\"source\"}],\"variables\":[],\"procedure\":{},\"schedule\":{},\"viewport\":{\"x\":-70.97383835138908